{
  "info": {
    "name": "TC-M04-G028 - Normalizacion de variables ambientales y recalculo proporcional de pesos ante factor faltante (RF-68 CA-12, E3, Paso 3/5.2)",
    "description": "Subcasos: (1) TC-M04-05 clamping de T_norm y HR_norm a [0,1] (T=40 C -> 1.25 sin acotar; HR=25% -> -0.30) con Fa=(1.0+0.0)/2=0.50. (2) TC-M04-06 sin datos ambientales: pesos 0.7143/0.2857, P=0.8642 (Alto) y supresion de alerta por confianza_baja. Rangos de normalizacion configurados en RF-65: temp 20-36 C, humedad 40-90%. ENDPOINT PROVISIONAL: en el backend actual no existe una ruta publica para calcular el riesgo de contagio (ficha: 'No existe ningun endpoint'). La ruta se toma de la variable de coleccion ruta_contagio y debe ajustarse al contrato real cuando exista. Los campos qa_* son GANCHOS DE PRUEBA PROPUESTOS (modelo/latencia/fallo/datos simulados) que deben acordarse con backend/AIOT y estar habilitados solo en el ambiente TEST. VARIABLES A CONFIGURAR (ambiente TEST): id_lote (lote con activos y sensores), ruta_contagio (provisional), contagio_banda_medio_min / contagio_banda_alto_min (limites de bandas de RF-65), correo_/contrasena_ de los roles usados. Script sin ejecutar: el ambiente aun no esta listo. SANDBOX TRANSACCIONAL: la coleccion genera un run_id y lo envia en el header X-Test-Run-Id (con X-Sandbox-Secret) en todas las peticiones; el ultimo item (Z. Teardown) hace DELETE /test-control/runs/{{run_id}} y revierte todo lo que la corrida escribio, por eso no hay codigo de limpieza. Requiere ENABLE_TEST_SANDBOX=true en el backend TEST y la variable sandbox_secret (-e sandbox_secret=... o --env-var), nunca escrita en el repositorio. No usar --bail (si la corrida se corta, el backend la cierra solo a los 180 s). Maximo 5 corridas simultaneas. Ambientes: DEV https://api.inmero.co/api-sgpmp-dev, TEST https://api.inmero.co/api-sgpmp-test (valor por defecto de base_url); MAIN (https://api.inmero.co/sigab) NO se prueba. REPORTE PROPIO: newman run tc-m04-g028.json -e <environment>.json --env-var sandbox_secret=<SECRETO_SANDBOX> -r cli,htmlextra --reporter-htmlextra-export resultados/resultado_TC-M04-G028.html  (npm i -g newman newman-reporter-htmlextra; crear la carpeta resultados).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Sandbox transaccional: un run_id unico por corrida, enviado en TODAS las peticiones.",
          "if (!pm.variables.has('run_id')) {",
          "    pm.variables.set('run_id', 'test-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));",
          "}",
          "if (!pm.variables.get('sandbox_secret')) { console.warn('Falta la variable sandbox_secret (secreto del sandbox; pedirlo al DBA y pasarlo como variable de entorno de Newman).'); }",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Test-Run-Id', value: pm.variables.get('run_id') });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Sandbox-Secret', value: pm.variables.get('sandbox_secret') || '' });"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "https://api.inmero.co/api-sgpmp-test"
    },
    {
      "key": "sandbox_secret",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "correo_admin",
      "value": "admin.test@sgpmp.com.co"
    },
    {
      "key": "contrasena_admin",
      "value": "Administrador123#"
    },
    {
      "key": "token_admin",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "ruta_contagio",
      "value": "/prediccion/riesgo-contagio"
    },
    {
      "key": "id_lote",
      "value": "210"
    },
    {
      "key": "id_lote_finca_a",
      "value": "210"
    },
    {
      "key": "contagio_banda_medio_min",
      "value": "0.40"
    },
    {
      "key": "contagio_banda_alto_min",
      "value": "0.60"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0A. Login admin.test (Administrador)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Login admin.test (Administrador) exitoso (200)', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "try { pm.collectionVariables.set('token_admin', pm.response.json().token); } catch (e) {}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/sesiones/",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"correo_electronico\": \"{{correo_admin}}\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"{{contrasena_admin}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "0. Preparacion",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "0C. Configurar pesos 0.5/0.3/0.2 y rangos ambientales (T 20-36 C, HR 40-90 %)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/prediccion/motor-ia",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"tipo_modelo\": \"MODELO_RIESGO_CONTAGIO\",\n  \"ventana_temporal_min\": 10,\n  \"modo_ejecucion\": \"SERVIDOR\",\n  \"umbral_riesgo_alto\": 0.5,\n  \"umbral_alerta_critica\": 0.75,\n  \"w_factor_sanitario\": 0.5,\n  \"w_factor_ambiental\": 0.3,\n  \"w_factor_densidad\": 0.2,\n  \"temp_min_config\": 20,\n  \"temp_max_config\": 36,\n  \"hr_min_config\": 40,\n  \"hr_max_config\": 90,\n  \"densidad_maxima_config\": 15\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const _n = Date.now(); const _iso = (ms) => new Date(ms).toISOString();",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_now', _iso(_n));",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_m1s', _iso(_n - 1000));",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_m10m', _iso(_n - 10*60000));",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_m20m', _iso(_n - 20*60000));",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_m31m', _iso(_n - 31*60000));",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_p1h', _iso(_n + 3600000));",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_p10m', _iso(_n + 10*60000));",
                  "pm.variables.set('uniq', String(_n).slice(-9));",
                  "const _d = (n) => new Date(Date.now() - n*864e5).toISOString().slice(0,10);",
                  "pm.variables.set('hoy', _d(0)); pm.variables.set('ayer', _d(1)); pm.variables.set('manana', _d(-1));",
                  "pm.variables.set('hoy_m30', _d(30)); pm.variables.set('hoy_m89', _d(89)); pm.variables.set('hoy_m90', _d(90)); pm.variables.set('hoy_m91', _d(91)); pm.variables.set('hoy_m60', _d(60));",
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('periodo_ini')) pm.variables.set('periodo_ini', _d(30)); else pm.variables.set('periodo_ini', pm.collectionVariables.get('periodo_ini'));",
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('periodo_fin')) pm.variables.set('periodo_fin', _d(0)); else pm.variables.set('periodo_fin', pm.collectionVariables.get('periodo_fin'));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "console.log('[TC-M04-G028 0C.] status=' + pm.response.code + ' t=' + pm.response.responseTime + 'ms body=' + pm.response.text().slice(0, 600));",
                  "let J; try { J = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) { J = {}; }",
                  "pm.test('HTTP en 200/201', function () { pm.expect([200, 201]).to.include(pm.response.code); });",
                  "const R = (J && J.resultado) ? J.resultado : (J || {});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. TC-M04-05 - Clamping de temperatura y humedad",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 T_actual=40 C y HR_actual=25 %",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}{{ruta_contagio}}",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id_lote\": {{id_lote}},\n  \"timestamp_calculo\": \"{{ts_now}}\",\n  \"variables_ambientales\": {\n    \"temperatura\": 40,\n    \"humedad\": 25\n  },\n  \"qa_factores_simulados\": {\n    \"fs\": 0.2,\n    \"fd\": 0.8\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const _n = Date.now(); const _iso = (ms) => new Date(ms).toISOString();",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_now', _iso(_n));",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_m1s', _iso(_n - 1000));",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_m10m', _iso(_n - 10*60000));",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_m20m', _iso(_n - 20*60000));",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_m31m', _iso(_n - 31*60000));",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_p1h', _iso(_n + 3600000));",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_p10m', _iso(_n + 10*60000));",
                  "pm.variables.set('uniq', String(_n).slice(-9));",
                  "const _d = (n) => new Date(Date.now() - n*864e5).toISOString().slice(0,10);",
                  "pm.variables.set('hoy', _d(0)); pm.variables.set('ayer', _d(1)); pm.variables.set('manana', _d(-1));",
                  "pm.variables.set('hoy_m30', _d(30)); pm.variables.set('hoy_m89', _d(89)); pm.variables.set('hoy_m90', _d(90)); pm.variables.set('hoy_m91', _d(91)); pm.variables.set('hoy_m60', _d(60));",
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('periodo_ini')) pm.variables.set('periodo_ini', _d(30)); else pm.variables.set('periodo_ini', pm.collectionVariables.get('periodo_ini'));",
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('periodo_fin')) pm.variables.set('periodo_fin', _d(0)); else pm.variables.set('periodo_fin', pm.collectionVariables.get('periodo_fin'));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "console.log('[TC-M04-G028 1.1] status=' + pm.response.code + ' t=' + pm.response.responseTime + 'ms body=' + pm.response.text().slice(0, 600));",
                  "let J; try { J = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) { J = {}; }",
                  "pm.test('HTTP en 200/201', function () { pm.expect([200, 201]).to.include(pm.response.code); });",
                  "const R = (J && J.resultado) ? J.resultado : (J || {});",
                  "pm.test('T_norm satura a 1.0 y HR_norm a 0.0', function () { const d = R.detalle_factor_ambiental || R.detalle || {}; if (d.t_norm !== undefined) { pm.expect(Number(d.t_norm)).to.eql(1.0); pm.expect(Number(d.hr_norm)).to.eql(0.0); } });",
                  "pm.test(\"Fa = (1.0 + 0.0) / 2 = 0.50\", function () { pm.expect(Math.abs(Number(R.factor_ambiental !== undefined ? R.factor_ambiental : R.fa) - 0.5)).to.be.below(0.0005); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. TC-M04-06 - Factor ambiental faltante: recalculo proporcional y supresion de alerta",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2.1 Lote sin datos ambientales, Fs=0.85 y Fd=0.90",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}{{ruta_contagio}}",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id_lote\": {{id_lote}},\n  \"timestamp_calculo\": \"{{ts_now}}\",\n  \"qa_factores_simulados\": {\n    \"fs\": 0.85,\n    \"fd\": 0.9\n  },\n  \"qa_datos_lote\": {\n    \"sin_datos_ambientales\": true\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const _n = Date.now(); const _iso = (ms) => new Date(ms).toISOString();",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_now', _iso(_n));",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_m1s', _iso(_n - 1000));",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_m10m', _iso(_n - 10*60000));",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_m20m', _iso(_n - 20*60000));",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_m31m', _iso(_n - 31*60000));",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_p1h', _iso(_n + 3600000));",
                  "pm.variables.set('ts_p10m', _iso(_n + 10*60000));",
                  "pm.variables.set('uniq', String(_n).slice(-9));",
                  "const _d = (n) => new Date(Date.now() - n*864e5).toISOString().slice(0,10);",
                  "pm.variables.set('hoy', _d(0)); pm.variables.set('ayer', _d(1)); pm.variables.set('manana', _d(-1));",
                  "pm.variables.set('hoy_m30', _d(30)); pm.variables.set('hoy_m89', _d(89)); pm.variables.set('hoy_m90', _d(90)); pm.variables.set('hoy_m91', _d(91)); pm.variables.set('hoy_m60', _d(60));",
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('periodo_ini')) pm.variables.set('periodo_ini', _d(30)); else pm.variables.set('periodo_ini', pm.collectionVariables.get('periodo_ini'));",
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('periodo_fin')) pm.variables.set('periodo_fin', _d(0)); else pm.variables.set('periodo_fin', pm.collectionVariables.get('periodo_fin'));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "console.log('[TC-M04-G028 2.1] status=' + pm.response.code + ' t=' + pm.response.responseTime + 'ms body=' + pm.response.text().slice(0, 600));",
                  "let J; try { J = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) { J = {}; }",
                  "pm.test('HTTP en 200/201', function () { pm.expect([200, 201]).to.include(pm.response.code); });",
                  "const R = (J && J.resultado) ? J.resultado : (J || {});",
                  "const _w = R.pesos_aplicados || R.pesos || {};",
                  "pm.test('Pesos recalculados proporcionalmente: nuevo_W_fs = 0.7143', function () { pm.expect(Math.abs(Number(_w.w_fs !== undefined ? _w.w_fs : _w.w_factor_sanitario) - 0.7143)).to.be.below(0.0005); });",
                  "pm.test('Pesos recalculados proporcionalmente: nuevo_W_fd = 0.2857', function () { pm.expect(Math.abs(Number(_w.w_fd !== undefined ? _w.w_fd : _w.w_factor_densidad) - 0.2857)).to.be.below(0.0005); });",
                  "pm.test(\"P_contagio = 0.8642\", function () { pm.expect(Math.abs(Number(Number(R.probabilidad_contagio)) - 0.8642)).to.be.below(0.0005); });",
                  "pm.test(\"nivel_riesgo_contagio = Alto\", function () { pm.expect(String(R.nivel_riesgo_contagio).toLowerCase()).to.eql(\"alto\"); });",
                  "pm.test(\"confianza_baja = true\", function () { pm.expect(R.confianza_baja).to.eql(true); });",
                  "pm.test(\"alerta_id vacio (no se dispara alerta hacia RF-57)\", function () { pm.expect((R.alerta_id || R.id_alerta || (R.alerta && (R.alerta.id_alerta || R.alerta.id)) || null) === null).to.be.true; });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Z. Teardown del sandbox - DELETE /test-control/runs/{{run_id}} (rollback)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Teardown del sandbox: rollback de la corrida (200/202/204)', function () { pm.expect([200, 202, 204]).to.include(pm.response.code); });",
              "console.log('[TC-M04-G028] teardown sandbox run_id=' + pm.variables.get('run_id') + ' status=' + pm.response.code);",
              "pm.variables.unset('run_id');"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/test-control/runs/{{run_id}}"
      }
    }
  ]
}